        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion TR-B9, Oval Rope Rose Hand Towel Towel Ring</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Oval Rope Mount Towel Ring is a great way to add a touch of classic elegance to the bathroom. This towel ring is easy to install and is great hanging next to the sink to hold hand towels. It is available in 5 finishes. The rope design is a true classic, and this wall mounted hand towel ring is a great addition to any traditional home.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/oval-rope-mount-towel-bar-fusion-tb-b9\"><b>Fusion TB-B9 Oval Rope Mount Towel Bar</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/oval-rope-mount-toilet-paper-holder-fusion-ph-b9\"><b>Fusion PH-B9 Oval Rope Mount Toilet Paper Holder</b></a>, and\r\n<a href=\"/products/oval-rope-mount-robe-hook-fusion-rh-b9\"><b>Fusion RH-B9 Oval Rope Mount Robe Hook</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Oval Rope Trim Wall Mounted Towel Ring:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
